  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758552,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## James Bond 007: Nightfire - PlayStation 2\n\nStep into the sleek world of espionage as James Bond in *007: Nightfire* for PlayStation 2! This action-packed first-person shooter puts you in the role of the iconic British secret agent as he investigates industrialist Raphael Drake’s suspicious dismantling of global warheads. Drake’s philanthropic facade hides a sinister plot to conquer the world using a powerful U.S. Space Weapons Platform.\n\nDeveloped by Eurocom, *Nightfire* delivers thrilling missions across exotic locales, from underwater bases to space stations. While Pierce Brosnan lends his likeness to the character, Maxwell Caulfield provides the voice acting. Engage in intense firefights utilizing a diverse arsenal of real-world inspired weaponry, including silenced pistols, machine guns, and explosive gadgets. Experience a blend of stealth and explosive action, complete with driving sequences reminiscent of *Spy Hunter*. \n\nFeaturing a robust multiplayer mode and a compelling storyline, *007: Nightfire* offers a definitive James Bond gaming experience. Collect \"007 tokens\" to unlock special rewards and execute signature \"Bond Moments\" to outwit your enemies."
    },
